# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
## [2.0.1]

### Changed
- Added `[cellannotation_setname]--negative_marker_genes` to `obs` section 

## [2.0.0]

### Changed
- Moved most `uns` fields into `uns["cap_metadata"]` dict container to prevent conflicts with other AnnData schemas
- `uns["title"]` remains at top level for compatibility with other AnnData schemas


## [1.0.2]

### Added
- Added `[cellannotation_setname]--confidence_score` to `obs` section

## [1.0.1]

### Added
- Added `hierarchy` to `uns` section

## [1.0.0]

### Changed
- Renamed `dataset_title` to `title`
- Renamed `dataset_description` to `description`
- Renamed `cellannotation_setdescription` to `description` 
